// Test: Evidence lattice rule - Known + Reported = Reported
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § 2.2 Evidence Lattice
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that combining Known (!) and Reported (~) evidence
// follows the pessimistic lattice rule: ! + ~ = ~
//
// Expected behavior:
// When adding a Known value and a Reported value, the result
// should have Reported evidence. Should print 119 (42 + 77).

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42;
    ≔ y: ~i32 = 77;
    ≔ z = x + y;  // Should be ~i32
    println(z);
}
